/target-cov/
/target-detego/

# The learned-detection crate is its own workspace root, so it builds into its
# own target directory rather than the shared one. Excluded from the atlas sync
# too: it was not, and once anyone had run a build here every sync offered to
# delete several hundred files on the far side, which the delete guard refused.
crates/detego-ml/target/
